    { "id": "wo-list-read", "mechanism": "api-read", "description": "同一個登入者（總務工單管理）、同一個搜尋，舊版 GET /api/maintenance-requests 與新版 GET /work-orders 逐列比對共同欄位（標題、說明、狀態、階段、門市、回報人、承辦、處理方式、廠商、分類、各時間、需求單連結）；新版多回顯示欄位、焦點卡全量計數與頁面權限，少回 store／category 巢狀物件與送確認人。", "legacy": { "api": { "path": "/api/maintenance-requests" } }, "native": { "api": { "path": "/api/workspace/general-affairs/work-orders" } }, "compareKey": "id" },
    { "id": "wo-detail-read", "mechanism": "api-read", "description": "同一張工單：舊版沒有單張詳情 API，以舊版列表列加舊版 GET /api/maintenance-updates 與新版詳情比對共同欄位與進度紀錄；新版多回時間軸、用料、照片、動作能力。", "legacy": { "api": { "path": "/api/maintenance-updates" } }, "native": { "api": { "path": "/api/workspace/general-affairs/work-orders/:id" } } },
